LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025 - Update 1)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
package gpu 4
variable        run_name string "Small NLR LAMMPS benchmark"
print           "--- Starting run: ${run_name} ---"
--- Starting run: Small NLR LAMMPS benchmark ---

variable 	thermo_print equal 250
variable	total_step equal ${thermo_print}*10
variable	total_step equal 250*10

units		real
boundary	p p p
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 10 every 1
atom_style	full
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
dihedral_style  harmonic
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 10.0
pair_modify     mix arithmetic
kspace_style    pppm 1e-4
read_data       ../data.begin
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.049808341 0.049808341 0.049808341) to (208.65137 208.65137 208.65137)
  2 by 4 by 4 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  744000 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  744000 velocities
  scanning bonds ...
  2 = max bonds/atom
  orthogonal box = (0.049808341 0.049808341 0.049808341) to (208.65137 208.65137 208.65137)
  2 by 4 by 4 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  648000 bonds
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     2 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     2 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
     4 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
     2 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.011 seconds
  read_data CPU = 5.004 seconds
fix		microcanonical all nve
timestep	1
thermo          ${thermo_print}
thermo          250
thermo_modify   flush yes
run             ${total_step}
run             2500

